( bounda_baseline_correction over [0,2] (manual 6.19), F5 T5 U9: the
  coefficients minimize the sum of the squared velocities of the 20 time
  steps (backward integration v_n = v_n-1 + a_n*dt, the same as the
  prescribed acceleration in bounda.cc). Sum of v^2: 21.68 without and
  6.34e-4 with the correction. The Professional 02-08-2026 gives other
  coefficients (-0.8183 -1.3759 2.1862) with a fit that could not be
  reproduced: DIVERGENCES BASELINE-CORRECTION-SIGNAL. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_acceleration
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
end_initia
inertia_apply -yes
node 1  0
node 2  1
element 1  -truss 1 2
group_type 0  -truss
group_truss_area 0  1.0
group_truss_elasti_young 0  1.0
group_truss_density 0  2.0
bounda_dof  10  1 -accx
bounda_time 10  0. 1.  0.5 1.  1. 1.  2. 0.
bounda_baseline_correction 0. 2.
control_timestep 10  0.1 2.
target_item  0  -bounda_baseline_correction_parameters 10 0
target_value 0  -0.9027362126125 1.e-10
target_item  1  -bounda_baseline_correction_parameters 10 1
target_value 1  -1.055204571298 1.e-10
target_item  2  -bounda_baseline_correction_parameters 10 2
target_value 2  2.050629834893 1.e-10
target_item  3  -node_dof 1 -velx
target_value 3  0.007889681447367 1.e-10
target_item  4  -node_dof 1 -disx
target_value 4  0.0007135443694872 1.e-10
end_data
